# DataLens AI

Ask natural language questions about your database. Get real-time streaming logs and instant Vega-Lite charts.

## Current State (as of 2026-03-25)

| Plan | Status | Summary |
|------|--------|---------|
| Plan 1 — Core Agent Loop | ✅ Done | NL→SQL→Vega pipeline, WebSocket, auth |
| Plan 2 — BUN Sandbox | ✅ Done | Server-side JS execution for complex transforms |
| Plan 2.5 — Hardening | ✅ Done | AsyncAnthropic, SQLite UserStore, timeout + rate limit |
| Frontend — DataLens UI | ✅ Done | Full two-panel UI: streaming logs, Vega charts, history |
| Plan 3 — Real-time Layer | 🔜 Next | CDC/Debezium, Kafka consumer, scheduled refresh |
| Plan 4 — Frontend Polish | 🔜 | Dashboard builder, DB connection wizard, saved queries |

## Architecture

```
User (browser)
  ↕ WebSocket (ws://localhost:8000/ws/query)
FastAPI app/main.py
  └── Coordinator (app/agents/coordinator.py)
        ├── SchemaAgent    → DB schema introspection, cached 10min per session
        ├── SQLAgent       → NL→SQL via Claude, retries 3x with error feedback
        ├── CodeExecAgent  → JS transform in BunSandbox (when needed)
        └── VizAgent       → rows + query → Vega-Lite v5 JSON spec
```

