## WebSocket Protocol

```
Client → {"type": "auth", "api_key": "nlq_..."}
Server → {"type": "authenticated"}
Client → {"type": "query", "query": "...", "dsn": "postgresql://..."}
Server → {"type": "progress", "message": "Analyzing schema..."}   (multiple)
Server → {"type": "sql", "sql": "SELECT ..."}
Server → {"type": "progress", "message": "Generating chart..."}
Server → {"type": "result", "vega_spec": "{...}", "sql": "SELECT ...", "rows": [...]}
         OR
Server → {"type": "error", "message": "..."}
```

## Running Locally

```bash
# Backend
cp .env.example .env   # add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY + SECRET_KEY
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000

# Register and get your API key
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/register \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"username": "yourname"}'

# Frontend
cd frontend
# create .env.local:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_KEY=nlq_<from_above>
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_DSN=postgresql://testuser:testpass@localhost:5432/testdb
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8000/ws/query
npm run dev   # → http://localhost:3000
```

## Tests

```bash
uv run pytest tests/unit/ -v                  # fast, no external services
uv run pytest tests/integration/ -v           # needs Postgres + ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
cd frontend && npx tsc --noEmit               # TypeScript check
cd frontend && npm run build                  # full build
```
